Advanced preferences pane (Skim+).

Fifth pane surfacing the Skim+ hidden preferences and a few of upstream's:
inverted page background level, tooltip timing, dark background colors
(WYSIWYG, gamut-snapped swatches), sequential page numbering. Also sets the
preference toolbar style so all five pane items fit the item strip.

